<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">chrysalis-construct</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Chrysalis Construct</ansi> spell coalesces a Chrysalis Core into a
permanent combat golem that fights alongside you. The ritual is
demanding and requires intense concentration to complete, but the
resulting construct serves as a tireless ally in battle.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast chrysalis-construct</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 20
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 40

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - Requires a Chrysalis Core in your inventory to cast.
  - The golem persists until destroyed or dismissed.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
